  "ai.orion81Builds": "Orion-81 yubakiye kuri porogaramu zo ku buntu zanditswe n'abantu. Ziri hano kuko zitakozwe na AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ni umushinga wakozwe wose na AI.<\/0> Buri murongo w'imyandikire bwite ya Orion-81 wanditswe na Claude Code, uyobowe n'uwashinze. Buri bwato, ikarita, ishusho yo ku mubiri n'ijwi byakozwe n'ibikoresho Claude Code yanditse. Uwashinze ni we ufata icyemezo cy'icyo kubaka; Claude Code ni yo imenya uko bikorwa. Amasomero yo ku buntu yubakiyeho yanditswe hepfo munsi ya 'Bitakozwe na AI'. Ikintu kimwe kiracyafunguye kandi kigaragara kinyuranye: <1>isuzuma ry'uruhushya<\/1> ry'imyandikire y'umukino yaturutse kuri prototype ya GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion yatangiye ku itariki ya 28 Nzeri 2026 nka prototype kuri moteri yo ku buntu ya Quake III Arena (GPL), iterwa inkunga n'ubwato bwo muri Elite Dangerous. Ku munsi wa kabiri, imyandikire y'umukino yimukiye kuri BuB, moteri nshya yanditswe na Claude Code; ibice by'umukino byavuye kuri prototype bihabwa andi mazina. Isohoka rya 0.3.0 ryahaye ibyiciro byose 16 by'ubwato imibiri mishya yabyo bwite. Isuzuma ryo kubahiriza uruhushya riragenzura niba hari imyandikire ikiri iyakomotse kuri GPL, no niba ibishushanyo by'ubwato bwa mbere bisa cyane n'ibyabiteye inkunga. Igenzura ryikora ryo kugereranya imyandikire n'inkomoko ya prototype ya GPL ryakozwe ku itariki ya 8 Ukwakira 2026, none isuzuma ry'impuguke ry'ibyabonetse riracyakomeje. Ikizagaragara ko cyakomotse kuri yo kizongera kwandikwa cyangwa gushushanywa bundi bushya.",
