  "economy.todayHead": "Ibiriho uyu munsi",
  "economy.todayLead": "Ibyiciro by'umubiri n'iby'ingabo n'amabara y'ingabo byo ku rupapuro rwa LOADOUT (0.6.0) byerekana ubwoko bw'ibyongerera n'ibyo gutaka ubukungu bugamije gutanga.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Kuko amafaranga winjiza agenewe kubahemba. Umukino utangira wose wakozwe na AI kugira ngo ubone uko ubaho, hanyuma abashushanya bahembwa basimbure akazi ka AI, bavugwe mu mazina.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Nshobora gukina kuri interineti?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Gukina ni ubuntu?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Ibibazo",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Oya, ntibirashoboka. Gukina kuri LAN ku muyoboro umwe birakora uyu munsi (kuva kuri 0.2.0); gukina kuri interineti ntibirakorwa.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Prototype yubatswe kuri moteri yo ku buntu ya Quake III Arena (GPL) kandi ifata ubwato bwo muri Elite Dangerous nk'isoko y'igitekerezo. Ku munsi wa kabiri, imyandikire y'umukino yimukiye kuri BuB, moteri nshya yanditswe na Claude Code; ibice by'umukino byavuye kuri prototype bihabwa andi mazina. Isohoka rya 0.3.0 ryahaye ibyiciro byose 16 by'ubwato imibiri mishya. Isuzuma ryo kubahiriza uruhushya riragenzura niba hari imyandikire ikiri iyakomotse kuri GPL, no niba ibishushanyo by'ubwato bwa mbere bisa cyane n'ibyabiteye inkunga. Igenzura ryikora ryo kugereranya imyandikire n'inkomoko ya prototype ya GPL ryakozwe ku itariki ya <0/>, none isuzuma ry'impuguke ry'ibyabonetse riracyakomeje. Ikizagaragara ko cyakomotse kuri yo kizongera kwandikwa cyangwa gushushanywa bundi bushya. Kugeza isuzuma rirangiye, ntitwemeza ko igisubizo ari oya.",
  "faq.questions": "Ibibazo",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Ubwato, ibishushanyo, imiterere n'ibindi, uko amafaranga azaboneka. <0>Urutonde rw'uru rupapuro<\/0> rwerekana buri kintu kandi ruzagaragaza buri gisimbuzwa n'uwagikoze.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Biteganyijwe ko ubwato n'ibyongerera ubwato bizaboneka mu gukina cyangwa bikagurwa. Uburyo ubwato bwishyuwe bugumana ubutabera mu ntambara y'abakinnyi hagati yabo biracyategurwa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Iyo ni gahunda: gukina ni ubuntu hamwe n'ifaranga ryo mu mukino n'ibyo gutaka byo guhitamo. Ntibirakorwa.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Hari akazi k'umuntu kakopowe?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Uzasohoka ryari, kandi kuri iki?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Ni ibihe bice abantu bazasimbura, kandi nzabimenya nte?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Kuki umukino wakozwe na AI wafasha abashushanya?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Uzaba ari uwo kwishyura kugira ngo utsinde?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "PC ya Windows. Nta tariki yo gusohoka cyangwa igiciro biraboneka.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude na Claude Code ni ibirango bya Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine na Epic Games ni ibirango bya Epic Games, Inc. Blender ni ikirango cya Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena na Elite Dangerous ni ibirango by'ababifite. Amazina yose ni aya ba nyirayo kandi akoreshwa gusa mu kugaragaza ibicuruzwa bivugwa. Orion-81 ntifitanye isano, ntiterwa inkunga cyangwa ngo yemezwe na kimwe muri byo.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Ni icyifuzo. Nta bufatanye, isano cyangwa ubuhamya buriho.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Umuyoboro uri mu nzira",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Inkuru y'iterambere kuri YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Kurikira Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Abafatanyabikorwa b'ahazaza?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Nta bikurikirana abakoresha. Nta cookie. Urubuga rw'ikigeragezo. Buri kintu cyose gishingiye ku bubiko bw'umushinga; nta kintu cyo hano ari ikiguzi cyangwa isezerano.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Ntiratangira",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Ikintu kimwe kiracyafunguye: <0>isuzuma ry'uruhushya<\/0> ry'imyandikire y'umukino yaturutse kuri prototype ya GPL. Igenzura ryikora ryo kugereranya imyandikire n'inkomoko ya prototype ryakozwe ku itariki ya <1/>, none isuzuma ry'impuguke ry'ibyabonetse riracyakomeje.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ni umushinga wakozwe wose na AI.<\/0> Imyandikire bwite ya Orion-81 yanditswe na Claude Code, iyobowe n'uwashinze; ubwato, amakarita, amashusho yo ku mubiri n'amajwi byakozwe n'ibikoresho Claude Code yanditse. Amasomero yo ku buntu ikoresha yanditswe munsi ya <1>'Bitakozwe na AI'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Hasi y'urubuga",
  "hero.behindThisPlate": "Inyuma y'iki kibaho: imiterere ya ORION-1 yo mu mukino, verisiyo 0.6.1, igaragara ako kanya muri brawuzeri yawe (yahinduwe ngo ikoreshwe kuri interineti, ishusho yo ku mubiri yagabanyijwe kugera kuri 512 px).",
  "hero.behindThisPlate2": "Inyuma y'iki kibaho: ifoto yafashwe mu mukino, verisiyo 0.6.1. 3D ikorana nawe yazimye kuri iki gikoresho.",
  "hero.exploreShips": "Reba ubwato",
  "hero.followKickstarter": "Kurikira Kickstarter",
  "hero.groundedSixDegrees": "Intambara yo mu isanzure ishingiye kuri fiziki, ifite impande esheshatu zo kugenda, kuva ku bwato bw'intambara bwa metero 12 kugeza ku bwato bukuru bwa km 1.2.",
  "hero.n100AiGenerated": "100 % BYAKOZWE NA AI  ·  0 % BYAKOZWE N'ABANTU KUGEZA UBU",
  "hero.notLiveYet": "Ntiratangira",
